+populated. ``N`` is the number of vmemmap pages required by the DAX mapping
+above::
+
+  Device DAX                  vmemmap pages (N pages)         backing page frames
+ +-----------+ ---virt_to_page---> +-----------+   mapping to   +-------------+
+ |           |                     |     0     | -------------> |      0      |
