+ |           |                     |     .     | ------+        +-------------+
+ |  PMD/PUD  |                     +-----------+       |        | A single,   |
+ |   level   |                     |     .     | ------+------> | per-zone    |
+ |  mapping  |                     +-----------+       |        | shared tail |
+ |           |                     |   N - 1   | ------+        | page        |
